raid.last.lost = Last raid: lost, {killed}/{raiders} down; burned: {building}. Raids won: {won}, lost: {lost}.
raid.command.cannotStart = Cannot start the raid: one is already running, or no camp could be placed (terrain not loaded?).
raid.command.noRaid = No raid under way here.
